 *   `KAINBAIN_SKIP_CANARY=1` for fast sanity cycles; `deploy.sh --prod`
 *   passes `--no-canary` to its `final-test-suite` gate and runs the canary
 *   suite as its own blocking `canary-e2e` gate, so nothing runs twice.
